module

/-!
A placeholder standing in for the calculus, so that the project builds before
one has been settled on.

What replaces it is compiled from the Eunoia signature in `signature/`: the term
datatype, the proof rules, the semantics they are stated against, and the
correctness proof of each rule. Until then this module holds only the names of
the two things that are already decided.
-/

public section

namespace @CALCULUS@

/-- The calculus this checker checks proofs in. -/
def calculusName : String := "@CALCULUS@"

/-- The checker itself. -/
def checkerName : String := "@CHECKER@"

end @CALCULUS@
